POST-RUN SELECTION AUDIT
The first finalization block above compared only full-feature LightGBM models.
That was inconsistent with the stated August-only selection rule because the
separately tuned common model had already won August MAE (85.772 vs 112.784).
Final artifacts therefore use the pre-holdout common L1/log winner at iteration
4083. No configuration changed and Sep-Oct was not used for this correction;
the saved comparison retains every one-time frozen-variant holdout result.
